# Code owners for the Golden Section Playbook.
#
# This file is the mechanism that enforces GP approval: when the ruleset on
# `main` requires code-owner review, a pull request cannot merge without an
# approval from someone listed here. See GOVERNANCE.md.
#
# The team must exist in the golden-section-tx organisation and must have write
# access to this repository, or GitHub silently ignores every rule below.
#
# NOTE, while the maintainers team has one member: GitHub does not let anyone
# approve their own pull request, so requiring an approval would lock the sole
# maintainer out of the repository entirely. The ruleset therefore requires a
# pull request and passing CI but zero approvals for now. Raise it to one
# approval with code-owner review the moment a second maintainer joins — that
# is the change that makes this file bite.

*                       @golden-section-tx/playbook-maintainers

# Licensing, governance, and contributor terms need a deliberate second look.
/LICENSE                @golden-section-tx/playbook-maintainers
/LICENSE-CODE           @golden-section-tx/playbook-maintainers
/NOTICE                 @golden-section-tx/playbook-maintainers
/CLA.md                 @golden-section-tx/playbook-maintainers
/GOVERNANCE.md          @golden-section-tx/playbook-maintainers
/CODEOWNERS             @golden-section-tx/playbook-maintainers

# The build script decides what every generated link says.
/scripts/               @golden-section-tx/playbook-maintainers
/.github/               @golden-section-tx/playbook-maintainers
